## HIGH

1. **H1 REGRESSED：fence 保留谓词仍破坏 Markdown 容器/围栏语义。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:349](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:349)、[vault_lint.py:382](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:382)、门仅覆盖 [test_vault_lint.py:1195](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1195)。

   失败场景：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py source -->
   ~~~lang`
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   [[A]]
   ~~~
   ```

   tilde fence 的 info string 合法包含反引号；原文 mdit 为 `fence map=[1,5], info='lang`'`。当前正则把 tilde 与 backtick fence 一并套用 `[^`]*`，误盲化 opener，`[[A]]` 泄漏成正文。list item opener `- ~~~text`、blockquote/list 前缀哨兵也同样漏保留或漏识别。

   真实 CLI 输出：`rc=0, status=ok, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1`；应为 A 报孤儿。

2. **H2 REGRESSED：标准嵌套深度已修，但畸形/围栏内 END 仍提前归零。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:345](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:345)、[vault_lint.py:374](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:374)、门仅覆盖 [test_vault_lint.py:1231](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1231)。

   `_AUTO_END_RE` 是前缀匹配，`<!-- /AUTO-GENERATEDNESS -->` 也会减深度：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED ... outer -->
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED ... inner -->
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATEDNESS -->
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   [[A]]
   ```

   同样，preserved fence 内作为代码内容出现的 `<!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->` 也会被状态机计作真实 END。两种实跑均得到 `rc=0 / orphans=[] / inbound_targets=1`；按外层未闭合到 EOF 的规则，A 应继续被盲化。

3. **H3 REGRESSED：绑定的是 token 行区间的 target 集合，不是具体 occurrence。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:400](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:400)、[vault_lint.py:465](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:465)、最终 orphan 接线 [vault_lint.py:573](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:573)。新门 [test_vault_lint.py:1248](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1248) 只测 B 真/A 假的异 target。

   ```md
   `[[A]]` \[\[A\]\]
   ```

   raw 集合从 `code_inline` 收到 `a`；mdit 又把转义假链解码为 text `[[A]]`，membership 因同名而通过。跨 softbreak、HTML comment/attribute 载体均可复现。

   真实 CLI：`rc=0, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1`。更强反例 `[[X&#65;]] \[\[X&\]\]` 会把真实 `XA` 链错截为 `x&`，实跑错误报告 `节点/XA.md` 为孤儿，并错误豁免 `X&`。

